Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 01:08:21 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 31/43] feat: Arathi Basin orders per raid group and
 .playerbots raid console command

"ab <t1..t8|all> <node|free>" (Portuguese node names accepted) pins the
objective of the bots in that raid subgroup until "free"; the order is keyed
to the battleground instance. ".playerbots raid <player> <text>" says text in
that player's raid chat on their behalf (voice bridge entry point).

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Vn4vD1fiBmsMGCCvsiqU7z
